# tally 2.2 (CHANGES.md 2.2-1), L §5.10, §8.3 LOAD-UNIT: a place of unit `any` takes no balance reading, since it is
# the world beyond the model: a stated row of the prelude's `world` is refused at load. 2.1.8 loaded it and printed
# an anchor with a hole difference.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  anchor world
  opening[konto] = 10.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  stated[world] = 5.00 PLN at 2026-03-31 end "s"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-04-30)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT stated[world]: a place of unit any takes no balance reading (m.tally:18)
